WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.320
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today,&nbsp;
I’m going to explain a science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:09.280
fiction thriller film called “The Titan.” 
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
 
&nbsp;

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.440
The premise of the movie is based in 2048.&nbsp;
Several cars drive along the Atlantic ocean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:23.120
to the NATO operating base. One of the cars stops&nbsp;
in front of a mansion. A woman shows a family of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:29.200
three inside the mansion, which is now their new&nbsp;
home. The father, Rick Janssen, his wife, Dr.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:34.880
Abigail Janssen, and his son, Lucas are surprised,&nbsp;
clearly not used to the lavishness of the place.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.920
The three stand in front of their private swimming&nbsp;
pool, when Lucas asks Rick where he is going.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:45.520
Ric shows him a direction towards the sky. The&nbsp;
camera pans out showing similar houses in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.680
neighborhood, suggesting that the people who came&nbsp;
in the other cars were given similar houses.
&nbsp;

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.760
The next morning, Professor Martin&nbsp;
Collingwood visits the family.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:58.240
The couple is happy to see him. Rick thanks the&nbsp;
professor for selecting him for the mission,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.000
but the professor instead reminds him&nbsp;
of the risks involved in the mission.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.960
The professor says he is grateful&nbsp;
for their service, and leaves. 
&nbsp;

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:09.680
Cut to a NATO conference. The&nbsp;
professor speaks in front of a group.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:15.200
In the year 2048, the earth’s natural resources&nbsp;
have been used to their pieces. People begin to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:19.280
fight for whatever remains of the resources, and&nbsp;
wars between the countries are prevalent. 
&nbsp;

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.040
He predicts that in ten years, half of the planet&nbsp;
will be uninhabitable, and in fifteen years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:29.440
half of the world’s current population will&nbsp;
starve to death. Human being’s time is running&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:33.600
out because they have outgrown their homes. The&nbsp;
professor claims that their children will witness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:38.640
the end of the world. However, amidst all this,&nbsp;
he claims that there is hope, the hope being the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:43.920
largest moon of Saturn named Titan. The only other&nbsp;
body besides Earth in the solar system that has an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:48.560
atmosphere, making it the most inhabitable&nbsp;
body in the solar system besides the Earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:53.600
But it is in no way ready to be inhabited by&nbsp;
humans. As liquid methane rains on the heavenly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:57.840
body, the atmosphere is filled with nitrogen,&nbsp;
and the temperature is extremely low. 
&nbsp;

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:02.880
The professor claims, space science says&nbsp;
that Titan cannot be livable for humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:07.360
but he has a different approach. He wants to&nbsp;
use modern genetics to make people adapt to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:11.120
the nature of the planet, rather than trying&nbsp;
to make the planet inhabitable for humans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:15.600
Hence, Rick and thirteen others in the team&nbsp;
have been called to be experimented upon to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:20.640
make them adapt to the environment of Titan. He&nbsp;
claims, with little enhancements in their body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:25.200
they will be able to breathe nitrogen in its air&nbsp;
and survive the cold of Titan. Everyone there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.680
knows of the risk of the experiment, but they&nbsp;
are willing to put their lives in danger, for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:34.800
future generation. Their main aim is to be able to&nbsp;
establish Titan as human’s new home planet.  
&nbsp;

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.720
The group has been chosen from five thousand&nbsp;
people in sixteen different countries for this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:43.600
specific task, because of their ability to&nbsp;
survive. One person at the convention argues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:48.240
that the process is a forced evolution and none of&nbsp;
them will survive in the end, but the others claim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:52.880
they know of the risks. After the convention,&nbsp;
the group is given their respective key cards&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:58.880
and taken to a lab. The experiment’s helper, Dr.&nbsp;
Freya Upton, gives Rick a shot and informs him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:03.120
that he will be getting over three hundred shots&nbsp;
in the next week. The shots are to train them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:08.160
to burn nitrogen instead of oxygen for energy,&nbsp;
because the level of oxygen in Titan is only 5%,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:13.200
which is less than earth’s 20%. 
Cut to their mansions, all fourteen of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:17.760
the volunteers and their families have been given&nbsp;
the lavish homes next to each other, hence Abigail&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:23.360
invites everyone for a barbecue weekend. They all&nbsp;
dance, eat and drink together. This is the last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:28.400
time they will be allowed to drink alcohol, so&nbsp;
they enjoy it. Abigail is drunk after the party,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:33.840
so Rick helps her get to their room; but before&nbsp;
they can, he begins to cough aggressively. Abigail&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:38.240
helps him and sees he is burning with fever. She&nbsp;
gives him some medicine and puts him to bed. 
&nbsp;

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:43.200
In the next experiment, the volunteers are&nbsp;
made to sit underwater for as long as they can.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:48.160
The last ones inside are Rick and a girl&nbsp;
named Tally. The two have been underwater&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:52.880
for thirty-one minutes. Everyone outside is happy&nbsp;
and surprised that the experiments have worked.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:56.880
Tally starts suffocating and goes to&nbsp;
the surface in thirty-nine minutes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:02.560
but Rick still stays inside. His vitals seem to&nbsp;
be dropping, so everyone gets worried. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.800
Rick starts swimming across the pool&nbsp;
at great speed, showing his progress.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:10.640
Everyone cheers and claps for him, he has&nbsp;
been underwater for forty-two minutes. 
&nbsp;

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.160
At night, Rick tells his son Lucas about&nbsp;
Titan’s conditions as a bedtime story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:20.880
The kid is thrilled to know that his father will&nbsp;
be able to live on another planet soon. Rick then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:25.200
joins his wife in the swimming pool, where she&nbsp;
notices the nerves on his back being prominent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:29.680
She labels it as a side effect of the shots&nbsp;
he has been given, but is worried for him. 
&nbsp;

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:36.320
As time goes by, Abigail and Rayenne, the wife of&nbsp;
another volunteer, become friends. Rayenne tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:40.160
her that she didn’t want her husband to come here,&nbsp;
but he doesn’t listen to anything she says. 
&nbsp;

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:45.200
Rick goes through surgery that&nbsp;
day. Abigail, being a doctor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:48.880
reads the book they were given, that has&nbsp;
all the procedures Rick has to go through.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:55.280
She sees that all of them are safe, so she is&nbsp;
relieved. At night, she wakes up, and notices that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.280 --> 00:05:00.720
Rick is missing from their bed. She goes to the&nbsp;
kitchen, and sees him applying ice on his body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:05.600
He says he was burning in their bed. Abigail&nbsp;
brings out a bucket of ice and Rick puts his hands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:10.960
in there. He asks his wife to do the same, but she&nbsp;
brings her hands out, not bearing the cold. Rick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:15.840
then claims that he cannot feel any cold. He has&nbsp;
adapted to live in Titan’s cold temperature. 
&nbsp;

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:21.040
In one experiment, the group is made to swim&nbsp;
underwater as the place is filled with methane&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:26.400
gas as it would be on Titan. Next, they are made&nbsp;
to run around a field for as long as they can,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:31.920
while breathing methane and nitrogen. They do the&nbsp;
same exercise for several days. The group is in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:36.960
the changing room, when Rick notices a lot of his&nbsp;
hair falling. Tally tries to see if it’s true and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:42.000
gets a lump of hair out of his head. Just then,&nbsp;
one of the female volunteers vomits out blood and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:47.200
falls on the ground struggling. The others try to&nbsp;
help her and call the officials. Dr. Freya tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:52.320
to help her, but she dies on the ground before she&nbsp;
can do anything. The group is shocked as the harsh&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:57.680
reality of the experiment is starting to show. 
That night, everyone gathers at Rick’s home again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:02.080
and discusses the matter. Abigail notices&nbsp;
all the volunteers’ nerves being prominent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:05.840
for some seconds, and then disappearing,&nbsp;
although no one else seems to notice. 
&nbsp;

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:11.200
Rayenne and her husband are outside in the pool.&nbsp;
Her husband has been panicking because of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:16.560
death. As the others talk, he hits Rayenne on&nbsp;
her face and loses control. The others go to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:21.280
help the girl, and restrain the man. His brain&nbsp;
has not been handling the experiments well. 
&nbsp;

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:26.640
The following day, Dr. Freya comes over&nbsp;
to Rick’s to test his vitals. She claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:30.800
that the girl who died has kidney stones which&nbsp;
altered the experiments, causing her to die. 
&nbsp;

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:37.120
At night, Rick cannot stop vomiting blood. Abigail&nbsp;
takes a sample of it to investigate it herself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:40.960
While shutting the doors, she sees&nbsp;
a light blinking from the walls,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:45.760
and realizes that they are being watched. Rick&nbsp;
is in the swimming pool, when his skin starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:50.320
to peel off and float. Later when they sleep,&nbsp;
Abigail sees Rick’s back has peeled too. 
&nbsp;

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.960
Abigail takes the sample to the lab the&nbsp;
next morning, and sees that it has several&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:59.200
compounds that the book didn’t talk about.&nbsp;
The lab performs eye surgery on Rick that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:04.000
day. It is to allow him to see through the&nbsp;
darkness. He goes home after the surgery,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.840
but has to be rushed back to the hospital when&nbsp;
his eyes start to bleed uncontrollably. 
&nbsp;

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.880
Abigail meets the professor, and accuses him of&nbsp;
not telling them everything about the procedure.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:17.360
She confronts him about the cameras&nbsp;
that he claims are for security reasons.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:21.840
He dismisses her and sends her home. As&nbsp;
soon as she is home, she sees large army&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:27.360
vans arriving at Rayenne’s home. She rushes to&nbsp;
see what is happening, but a soldier stops her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:32.480
Just then, someone throws Rayenne out of the&nbsp;
window, her dead body is lying on the front porch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:35.600
Rayenne’s husband has gone completely&nbsp;
wild because of the experiments.
&nbsp;

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:40.320
One night, Abigail takes Rick’s key&nbsp;
card and sneaks into the facility.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:45.120
She finds the volunteers’ medical file and sees&nbsp;
that the girl who died didn’t have kidney stones.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:50.240
The professor and the team are in a meeting with&nbsp;
NASA. The professor is chastised for doing forced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:55.040
evolutionary experimentation without proper&nbsp;
evidence or ethical reasons. He is threatened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:59.120
with having his operation shut down. 
When the professor comes to visit Rick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.680
at his home, he tells Abigail that he does not&nbsp;
actually know the effects of the experiments yet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:08.400
but they cannot go back now. The subjects will&nbsp;
be turned into a new species of humans called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:13.040
the Homo Titaniens, and will be different from&nbsp;
Homo sapiens, but since everybody evolves in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:16.640
different way, they do not know what Rick&nbsp;
will turn to after the full experiment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:21.600
Later, Rick opens the bandage from his eyes&nbsp;
and is surprised to see everything around,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:27.200
even in the dark. His eyes have evolved.
The following day, they perform a vital surgery on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:32.800
the subjects, but all of them die except for Rick&nbsp;
and Tally. Now, the future of humanity lies on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:38.000
two. Abigail is brought to the facility after the&nbsp;
surgery, and is surprised to see her husband turn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:43.040
into a different creature altogether. But it is&nbsp;
evident that he still remembers them. They have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:48.160
turned completely into Homo Titaniens. They can&nbsp;
listen to the humans talking, but cannot talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:52.400
back because they communicate in a low frequency&nbsp;
that is undetectable by normal human ears.
&nbsp;

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:58.320
Rick comes home that night, and accidentally hits&nbsp;
Abigail. He is later swimming, when a loud thud&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:03.840
is heard outside. Tally has come to visit him.&nbsp;
With her, several guards also approach the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:09.360
It turns out that she has killed her husband. The&nbsp;
soldiers sedate Tally and try to take Rick too,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:14.320
but he easily kills them all with his newfound&nbsp;
power. He only stops when Abigail asks him to.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:19.840
The officials then take him to the facility and&nbsp;
keep him in a glass cell. Rick is now ready to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:25.040
be sent to Titan, but his emotional attachment&nbsp;
with Abigail and Lucas stops him from proceeding,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:29.600
so the professor asks Abigail to inject&nbsp;
him with a compound to erase his memories.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.360
Abigail obliges and gives him&nbsp;
the shot. Rick shakes his head,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:38.240
suggesting that he doesn’t want to forget her.&nbsp;
Abigail comes out of the cell, takes Lucas and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:43.040
Dr. Freya, and runs away, as it turns out she gave&nbsp;
him a different compound to help him escape. 
&nbsp;

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:48.720
Rick pretends to be unconscious and kills a&nbsp;
soldier. The others are alerted, but his evolved&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:53.840
abilities help him escape easily. Rick meets his&nbsp;
wife and son in one of the labs, but is quickly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:59.040
surrounded by soldiers. The professor explains&nbsp;
to Abagail that Rick’s evolution is irreversible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:04.240
and he cannot go back to being human now. His&nbsp;
only way to survive is to go to Titan. Seeing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:09.120
that she has completely lost her old husband,&nbsp;
Abigail finally agrees to let him go away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:14.320
for the sake of humanity and its survival. 
In the next scene, we see them in an airplane.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:19.360
Rick lies in a body bag and is being taken to&nbsp;
be sent to Titan. Cut to a few months later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:24.080
the professor has been arrested for using&nbsp;
unethical methods. Abigail and Freya have taken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:29.120
over the Titan II facility. Lucas calls his mother&nbsp;
outside to make her look at the clear night sky.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:34.000
Somewhere far away in the galaxy, we see&nbsp;
Rick standing on the mountains of Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:38.720
He has fully adapted to its environment. He&nbsp;
spreads his webbed arms and flies in its sky.
&nbsp;

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:42.800
Subscribe for more videos like&nbsp;
this, turn on notifications,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:45.760
and leave a like to help the channel&nbsp;
out. Thank you for watching.

